flowchart TB
    User((User)) --> EditConfig["Edit config.json\n{rtsp: {enabled: true}}"]
    EditConfig --> StartDaemon["Start daemon\nodc-onboard --daemon"]
    StartDaemon --> SocketExists{"Socket at\n/run/odc-onboard/ ?"}
    SocketExists -->|yes| CLIConnect["CLI auto-connects to daemon\n(no --cli flag needed)"]
    SocketExists -->|no| Timeout["Socket poll timeout\n→ FAIL"]
    CLIConnect --> UserCommands["User runs CLI commands"]

    subgraph Commands["CLI Commands"]
        Status["rtsp status\n→ list all compressors"]
        Start["rtsp start mycam wg0 10.0.0.1\n→ spawn compressor thread"]
        Stop["rtsp stop mycam\n→ quit GLib loop, join thread"]
        Help["rtsp help\n→ show usage info"]
    end

    UserCommands --> Status & Start & Stop & Help

    Start --> SpawnThread["std::thread created\nGMainLoop runs\nRtspBridge starts"]
    SpawnThread --> StatusResult["rtsp status now shows:\nconnection: mycam\nrunning: yes"]
    Stop --> ThreadJoin["glib_thread.join()\nbridge->stop()"]
    ThreadJoin --> EmptyStatus["rtsp status: No compressor instances active"]
